<p>Hi <%= @request.account&.first_name.presence || @request.guest_name.to_s.split(" ").first.presence || "there" %>,</p>

<p>Please find your invoice attached as a PDF.</p>

<p>
  <strong>Invoice:</strong> <%= @invoice_number %><br>
  <strong>Analysis request:</strong> <%= @request.reference %> — <%= @request.title %><br>
  <strong>Package:</strong> <%= @request.package_name %><br>
  <strong>Amount:</strong> <%= @amount_aud %><br>
  <strong>Issued:</strong> <%= @issued_on %><br>
  <strong>Payment reference:</strong> <%= @payment_reference %>
</p>

<% if @invoice.status == "paid" %>
  <p>This invoice is already marked as paid — thank you. No further action is needed.</p>
<% else %>
  <h2>What happens next</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Pay the amount shown on the invoice, quoting <%= @payment_reference %>.</li>
    <li>We mark the invoice paid as soon as the transfer clears.</li>
    <li>Analysis work begins, and we email you when your report is ready.</li>
  </ol>
<% end %>

<p>
  The attachment is a self-contained PDF copy of the invoice.
  Questions? Reply to this email and the team will help.
</p>

<p>Beach Volleyball Hub</p>
